  "refresh": "30s",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "type": "textbox",
        "name": "trace_id",
        "label": "Trace ID",
        "query": "",
        "current": {
          "text": "",
          "value": ""
        },
        "hide": 0
      },
      {
        "type": "textbox",
        "name": "client",
        "label": "Anonymised IP",
        "query": "",
        "current": {
          "text": "",
          "value": ""
        },
        "hide": 0
      }
    ]
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "title": "",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 5
      },
      "transparent": true,
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "### Live telemetry from [rmcinnes.co.uk](https://rmcinnes.co.uk)\nEvery page view on the site is traced with **OpenTelemetry** and stored in the **LGTM stack**: **L**oki for logs, **G**rafana for this dashboard, **T**empo for traces and **M**imir for metrics, collected by Grafana Alloy. Your own visit is in here too: follow the *See it live* link in the site's footer, or paste your trace ID above.\n\n**Privacy:** each page view is recorded with its method, path, status code, timing and browser user agent. **IP addresses are anonymised before they are stored** (the last block of an IPv4 address becomes 0; IPv6 is cut to the first 48 bits). Nothing typed into the contact form is recorded. Data is kept for 7 days."
      },
      "id": 1
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Page views (24h)",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "loki",
        "uid": "loki"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 5,
        "w": 6,
        "h": 4
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "loki",
            "uid": "loki"
          },
          "expr": "sum(count_over_time({service_name=\"rmcinnes\"} | event=\"request\" | user_agent!=\"rmcinnes-status-check\" [24h]))",
          "queryType": "instant"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "color": {
            "mode": "fixed",
            "fixedColor": "#86e1c6"
          },
          "noValue": "0"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "value",
        "justifyMode": "center",
        "orientation": "auto"
      },
      "id": 2
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
